# --- Tool-loop guard + busy-queue merge_text=True (NOT YET CARRIED) ---
# 7f7e52cd12 Cherry-pick: tool-loop guard + merge_text=True on busy-queue paths
#
# This commit lives on the older jasnoor/v0.15.2-jasnoor-working-code branch
# but was NOT re-cherry-picked onto jasnoor/v2026.7.7.2-custom (v0.18.2's
# run_agent.py and gateway/run.py have moved enough that the v0.15.2-era
# patch needs manual conflict resolution per release).
#
# Action: re-cherry-pick 7f7e52cd12 by hand onto each new release overlay
# branch (outside this manifest) and resolve conflicts interactively. If
# the v0.19.0 run_agent.py already contains the tool-loop guard, skip the
# cherry-pick and remove this comment.

# --- Signal attachment PRs (NOT IN THIS MANIFEST) ---
# The 4 signal PRs (AAC remux, route non-media, contentType rescue, Telegram
# parity) live on jasnoor/v0.15.2-jasnoor-working-code. They were cherry-picked
# onto jasnoor/v2026.7.7.2-custom (commits b9df769f63, f8cf5d11df, a5a82021ba)
# but PR 1 (AAC remux) was a no-op against v0.18.2.
#
# For each new release:
#   1. Re-cherry-pick the 4 PRs in order (handles merge conflicts per release)
#   2. Skip any that are no-ops against the new base
#   3. Do NOT add them to this manifest — the script doesn't know which
#      ones to skip
# Canonical SHAs from jasnoor/v0.15.2-jasnoor-working-code:
